      "en": "DATA",
      "title": "需要准备什么",
      "html": "<p>数据清单按\"能不能拿到、要不要标注\"排序。勾选只看本页状态，用来判断自己手里缺哪一项。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 3</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\" style=\"display:block\">管柱结构与材料</span><span class=\"cl-s\" style=\"display:block\">钢级、壁厚、下深</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">无需标注</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\" style=\"display:block\">工况参数</span><span class=\"cl-s\" style=\"display:block\">温度、压力、产量变化</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">可批量仿真生成</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\" style=\"display:block\">失效案例</span><span class=\"cl-s\" style=\"display:block\">断脱、泄漏记录</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">少量真实标签</span></div></div>"
