     {
      "no": 2,
      "en": "INTERVENTION",
      "title": "AI 能做什么",
      "html": "<p>用序列分割模型在钻时曲线上自动识别岩性界面，并与岩屑、气测曲线交叉验证。</p><p>把分层建模成<b>曲线上的变点检测</b>：滑窗比较界面两侧的均值差与方差，得到「界面得分」曲线，再按最小层厚约束挑峰。难点不在算法，而在把钻井参数归一化掉。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox='0 0 660 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='专业背景示意'><style>@keyframes faFlow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-24}}.fa-flow{stroke-dasharray:5 7;animation:faFlow 1.6s linear infinite}@keyframes faPulse{0%,100%{opacity:.4}50%{opacity:1}}.fa-pulse{animation:faPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes faRise{0%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:0}18%{opacity:.9}100%{transform:translateY(-30px);opacity:0}}.fa-rise{animation:faRise 3.4s ease-in infinite}@keyframes faBlink{50%{opacity:.2}}.fa-blink{animation:faBlink 1.8s steps(2,end) infinite}@keyframes faStep{0%,100%{opacity:.3}8%,20%{opacity:1}}.fa-step{animation:faStep 6s ease-in-out infinite}@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.fa-flow,.fa-pulse,.fa-rise,.fa-blink,.fa-step{animation:none}}</style><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='250' fill='#fdfcf9'/><text x='16' y='16' font-size='10' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='start'>智能化的介入点 · 一段管线</text><text x='16' y='31' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='start'>把领域问题拆成可学习的子问题</text><rect x='24' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='76.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='24' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#41699b'/><text x='76' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>01</text><text x='76' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>钻时 + 钻压转速</text><line x1='130' y1='118' x2='153' y2='118' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M153 118L147.5 120.4L147.5 115.6Z' fill='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round'/><rect x='155' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='207.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='155' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='207' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>02</text><text x='207' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>参数归一化</text><line x1='261' y1='118' x2='284' y2='118' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M284 118L278.5 120.4L278.5 115.6Z' fill='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round'/><rect x='286' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='338.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='286' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='338' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>03</text><text x='338' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>滑窗变点</text><line x1='392' y1='118' x2='415' y2='118' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M415 118L409.5 120.4L409.5 115.6Z' fill='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round'/><rect x='417' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='469.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='417' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#a97a1c'/><text x='469' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>04</text><text x='469' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>界面深度</text><line x1='523' y1='118' x2='546' y2='118' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M546 118L540.5 120.4L540.5 115.6Z' fill='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round'/><rect x='548' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='600.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='548' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#79828a'/><text x='600' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>05</text><text x='600' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>解释员确认</text><text x='76' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>原始资料：影像 / 曲线</text><text x='76' y='182' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>文本 / 施工记录</text><text x='207' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>把领域知识变成特征</text><text x='207' y='182' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>或显式的表示</text><text x='338' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>小样本模型 + 物理约束</text><text x='338' y='182' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>（不是\"大模型一把梭\"）</text><text x='469' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>概率 / 排序 / 参数建议</text><text x='600' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>人工复核 → 回填 → 迭代</text><text x='600' y='182' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>下一轮更准</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 2</b><span>先剔除操作影响，再找界面；顺序反了，模型学到的是司钻的习惯。</span></div>"
     },
     {
      "no": 3,
      "en": "DATA",
      "title": "需要准备什么",
      "html": "<p>数据清单按\"能不能拿到、要不要标注\"排序。勾选只看本页状态，用来判断自己手里缺哪一项。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 3</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\" style=\"display:block\">钻时曲线</span><span class=\"cl-s\" style=\"display:block\">0.5—1 m 一点</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">人工划分界面 30—50 口井</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\" style=\"display:block\">钻井参数</span><span class=\"cl-s\" style=\"display:block\">钻压、转速、排量</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于归一化</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\" style=\"display:block\">岩屑与气测</span><span class=\"cl-s\" style=\"display:block\">同井段资料</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">交叉验证</span></div></div>"
     },
     {
      "no": 4,
      "en": "DIFFICULTY",
      "title": "难度与参考方向",
      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">难度不看模型大小，看标签质量与工况漂移。</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>单曲线信息量有限，需多源融合；迟到时间校正不准则标签本身有系统误差。</p><p>钻时曲线是「操作 + 岩性」的混合信号。只喂钻时，模型会把提钻、加钻压学成界面；把钻压、转速、排量作为协变量一起进模型，才是正确做法。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox='0 0 660 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='专业背景示意'><style>@keyframes faFlow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-24}}.fa-flow{stroke-dasharray:5 7;animation:faFlow 1.6s linear infinite}@keyframes faPulse{0%,100%{opacity:.4}50%{opacity:1}}.fa-pulse{animation:faPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes faRise{0%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:0}18%{opacity:.9}100%{transform:translateY(-30px);opacity:0}}.fa-rise{animation:faRise 3.4s ease-in infinite}@keyframes faBlink{50%{opacity:.2}}.fa-blink{animation:faBlink 1.8s steps(2,end) infinite}@keyframes faStep{0%,100%{opacity:.3}8%,20%{opacity:1}}.fa-step{animation:faStep 6s ease-in-out infinite}@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.fa-flow,.fa-pulse,.fa-rise,.fa-blink,.fa-step{animation:none}}</style><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='250' fill='#fdfcf9'/><text x='16' y='16' font-size='10' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='start'>人工 vs 智能化</text><text x='16' y='31' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='start'>同一项工作的人工耗时 / 智能化后耗时（小时）</text><text x='44' y='74' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='start'>单井卡层</text><rect x='44' y='80' width='520.0' height='10' rx='3' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><rect x='44' y='94' width='45.1' height='10' rx='3' fill='#2f7d6b' opacity='.9'/><text x='568.0' y='88' font-size='8' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='start'>人工 1.5小时</text><text x='93.1' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>AI 0.1小时</text><text x='44' y='116' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='start'>邻井对比</text><rect x='44' y='122' width='520.0' height='10' rx='3' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><rect x='44' y='136' width='130.0' height='10' rx='3' fill='#b26a39' opacity='.9'/><text x='568.0' y='130' font-size='8' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='start'>人工 0.8小时</text><text x='178.0' y='144' font-size='8' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>AI 0.2小时</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 4</b><span>机器给候选界面，人做邻井一致性检查——这一步目前还替代不了。</span></div><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">变点检测<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">多源融合<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">迟到时间校正<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
     }
