      "no": 2,
      "en": "INTERVENTION",
      "title": "AI 能做什么",
      "html": "<p>对地震切片或小立方体做图像分类，用井标定标签训练，输出相带概率体。</p><p>把地震剖面切成小片，用井标定的相带标签训练分类器，输出相带概率体。关键是<b>相带定义要统一</b>：先定标准，再训练，否则模型学的是解释员的个人习惯。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox='0 0 660 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='专业背景示意'><style>@keyframes faFlow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-24}}.fa-flow{stroke-dasharray:5 7;animation:faFlow 1.6s linear infinite}@keyframes faPulse{0%,100%{opacity:.4}50%{opacity:1}}.fa-pulse{animation:faPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes faRise{0%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:0}18%{opacity:.9}100%{transform:translateY(-30px);opacity:0}}.fa-rise{animation:faRise 3.4s ease-in infinite}@keyframes faBlink{50%{opacity:.2}}.fa-blink{animation:faBlink 1.8s steps(2,end) infinite}@keyframes faStep{0%,100%{opacity:.3}8%,20%{opacity:1}}.fa-step{animation:faStep 6s ease-in-out infinite}@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.fa-flow,.fa-pulse,.fa-rise,.fa-blink,.fa-step{animation:none}}</style><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='250' fill='#fdfcf9'/><text x='16' y='16' font-size='10' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='start'>智能化的介入点 · 一段管线</text><text x='16' y='31' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='start'>把领域问题拆成可学习的子问题</text><rect x='24' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='76.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='24' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#41699b'/><text x='76' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>01</text><text x='76' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>地震切片</text><line x1='130' y1='118' x2='153' y2='118' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M153 118L147.5 120.4L147.5 115.6Z' fill='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round'/><rect x='155' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='207.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='155' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='207' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>02</text><text x='207' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>纹理/结构特征</text><line x1='261' y1='118' x2='284' y2='118' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M284 118L278.5 120.4L278.5 115.6Z' fill='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round'/><rect x='286' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='338.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='286' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='338' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>03</text><text x='338' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>分类器</text><line x1='392' y1='118' x2='415' y2='118' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M415 118L409.5 120.4L409.5 115.6Z' fill='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round'/><rect x='417' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='469.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='417' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#a97a1c'/><text x='469' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>04</text><text x='469' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>相带概率</text><line x1='523' y1='118' x2='546' y2='118' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M546 118L540.5 120.4L540.5 115.6Z' fill='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round'/><rect x='548' y='82' width='104' height='74' rx='5' fill='#fff' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='1'/><text x='600.0' y='119.0' font-size='9' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'></text><rect x='548' y='82' width='104' height='6' rx='3' fill='#79828a'/><text x='600' y='102' font-size='8' font-family='JetBrains Mono,Consolas,monospace' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>05</text><text x='600' y='120' font-size='9.5' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>解释员校准</text><text x='76' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>原始资料：影像 / 曲线</text><text x='76' y='182' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>文本 / 施工记录</text><text x='207' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>把领域知识变成特征</text><text x='207' y='182' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>或显式的表示</text><text x='338' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>小样本模型 + 物理约束</text><text x='338' y='182' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>（不是\"大模型一把梭\"）</text><text x='469' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>概率 / 排序 / 参数建议</text><text x='600' y='172' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>人工复核 → 回填 → 迭代</text><text x='600' y='182' font-size='7.2' font-family='Inter,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>下一轮更准</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 2</b><span>相带定义先统一，模型才学得对；否则学的是个人偏好。</span></div>"
